                &lt;p&gt;Nature, Published online: 07 October 2026; &lt;a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03127-7"&gt;doi:10.1038/d41586-026-03127-7&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;The United Nations’ deadline for eliminating HIV/AIDS as a public-health threat is unlikely to be met. But medical, political and social advances have raised hopes that longer-term success is still possible.</content:encoded>
